{"type":"message","id":"6172b837","parentId":"9cc8cc26","timestamp":"2026-05-25T00:04:37.716Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The git push failed due to authentication issues with GitHub. This is likely because there's no credential helper configured or the credentials are not stored. I need to let the user know about this so they can set up credentials or use a different method.","thinkingSignature":"74c63bf9e2c8069824a10ba30f4352e0cd10627893511902dc846d1eb36adac5"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n备份失败：Git push 认证失败，无法连接到 GitHub。\n\n需要修复 Git 认证方式，可以用以下任一方法：\n\n1. **设置 SSH 密钥**（推荐）\n2. **配置 credentials helper**：`git config --global credential.helper store`\n\n或者先检查现有配置：\n```bash\ngit remote -v\ncat ~/.gitconfig\n```"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":12947,"output":124,"cacheRead":16832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29903,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779667474531,"responseId":"0662c513410dfeb9d3907b01a88f0a02"}}
